            "displayName": "Shahan Khatchadourian",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "In the current implementation, token offsets are not stored as they are provided in the Token. DocumentWriter makes a token's startOffset relative to +1 of the previous Token's endOffset.",
